B.PB=new A.bq("Fly Fishing Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","If you're coming to Alaska to fish, this gets you set up without having to bring a bunch of gear with you.\n\nThis package includes everything you need to get out on the water and start casting. Whether you've been fly fishing for years or you're just getting into it, it's a simple, ready-to-go setup that works well for local rivers and streams.\n\nThe goal is to keep it easy so you can focus on fishing instead of figuring out gear.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Fly rod and reel setup\n\u2022 Line and leader\n\u2022 Selection of flies\n\u2022 Basic tackle and essentials\n\nGood for:\n\n\u2022 Salmon fishing\n\u2022 Trout and grayling\n\u2022 Local rivers and streams\n\u2022 Beginners and experienced anglers\n\nNote: Gear may vary slightly depending on availability and season, but everything provided will be ready to fish.",30,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/47fdd0bb2_IMG_1654.jpeg",!0,!0,!1,B.a60,B.T)
B.abU=A.a(s(["Rod/Reel","Hip Waders","Landing Net","Lures","Backpack"]),t.s)
B.PA=new A.bq("King Salmon Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","If you're targeting king salmon, you need gear that can actually handle them. This setup is built for that.\n\nKings are big, powerful fish, and this package gives you a strong, reliable setup that's ready for Alaska conditions. No guesswork, no piecing things together \u2014 just gear that's meant to do the job.\n\nWhether you're fishing from shore or along a river, this gives you what you need to hook into something serious.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Heavy-duty rod and reel\n\u2022 Line suitable for king salmon\n\u2022 Terminal tackle and weights\n\u2022 Hip waders\n\u2022 Landing net\n\u2022 Lures\n\u2022 Backpack\n\nNote: Gear may vary slightly depending on availability, but everything included will be ready to fish.",30,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/1909908c9_PhotoJul01202232914PM.jpg",!0,!0,!1,B.abU,B.T)
B.a6d=A.a(s(["Rod/Reel","Lures","Ladle","Seat","Rod Case"]),t.s)
B.Pf=new A.bq("Ice Fishing Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","Ice fishing in Alaska isn't something you want to show up unprepared for. This package gives you the gear you need to get set up on the ice without having to bring your own.\n\nIt's a straightforward setup that lets you drill, drop a line, and start fishing without overthinking it. Whether you're out for a few hours or making a full day of it, this keeps things simple and ready to go.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Ice fishing rod and reel\n\u2022 Line and basic tackle\n\u2022 Scoop and essential gear\n\u2022 Seat\n\u2022 Rod Case\n\nGood for:\n\n\u2022 Frozen lakes and ponds\n\u2022 Trout and other freshwater species\n\u2022 First-timers and experienced anglers\n\u2022 Anyone wanting to try ice fishing without buying gear\n\nNote: Gear may vary slightly depending on availability, but everything included will be ready to fish.",20,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/dad7bcf27_IMG_1677.jpg",!0,!0,!1,B.a6d,B.T)
B.a9h=A.a(s(["Kid-sized rod and reel","Lures","Tackle box","Life jacket"]),t.s)
B.P0=new A.bq("Kids Fishing Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","A complete, easy-to-use setup sized for kids so they can get in on the action too.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Kid-sized fishing rod and reel\n\u2022 Selection of lures\n\u2022 Tackle box with essentials\n\u2022 Life jacket\n\nFree with any adult fishing package rental. Just let us know when you book and we'll throw it in.",15,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/7adc6e944_IMG_1196.jpg",!0,!0,!1,B.a9h,B.T)
B.aa2=A.a(s(["Rod/Reel","Hip Waders","Lures","Net","Stringer","Backpack"]),t.s)
B.P9=new A.bq("Salmon Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","Complete salmon fishing setup for Alaska's legendary runs.\n\nEverything you need to get on the water and start fishing, all in one package.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Rod and reel\n\u2022 Hip waders\n\u2022 Stringer\n\u2022 Net\n\u2022 Lures\n\u2022 Backpack\n\nGood for:\n\n\u2022 Silver, pink, chum, and red salmon runs\n\u2022 River banks and roadside access spots\n\u2022 Anglers of all experience levels",30,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/0cd44eca3_IMG_6555.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.aa2,B.T)
B.a0a=A.a(s(["Surf Rod/Reel","Rigging","Weights","Lures","Backpack"]),t.s)
B.Ph=new A.bq("Surf Fishing Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","If you want to fish from shore without hauling a bunch of gear with you, this has you covered.\n\nThis setup is built for casting out from beaches, river mouths, and roadside spots around Alaska. It's simple, solid gear that lets you get a line in the water without overthinking it.\n\nWhether you're just trying fishing for the first time or you want an easy setup for a quick trip, this package keeps things straightforward.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Rod and reel setup\n\u2022 Line and basic tackle\n\u2022 Weights and terminal gear\n\nGood for:\n\n\u2022 Shore fishing\n\u2022 River mouths and beaches\n\u2022 Quick stops off the road system\n\u2022 Beginners or anyone keeping it simple\n\nNote: Gear may vary slightly depending on availability, but everything included will be ready to fish.",30,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/c4016c860_IMG_6479.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.a0a,B.T)
B.a96=A.a(s(["Hooligan dip net","Bucket","Small cooler"]),t.s)
B.OV=new A.bq("Hooligan Package","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","Hooligan (eulachon) season on Turnagain Arm is short, weird, and a lot of fun. You stand in the water, dip a net, and pull out a bucket full of small, oily fish that locals smoke, dry, or fry up by the dozen.\n\nThis package keeps it simple: a sturdy dip net and a bucket. That's all you really need. Show up at the right tide on the right day, and you'll see why people set their calendars by it.\n\nHooligan season on Turnagain Arm typically runs late April through May. Always check Alaska Department of Fish & Game for current run timing and regulations before heading out.\n\nWhat's Included:\n\u2022 Hooligan dip net\n\u2022 Bucket\n\u2022 Small cooler",25,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/7a5d16b38_IMG_5906.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.a96,B.T)
B.Pk=new A.bq("Net","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","Landing net for securing your catch.",4,null,!1,!1,!1,B.k,B.T)
B.P1=new A.bq("Stringer","Fishing","\ud83c\udfa3","Fish stringer to keep your catch fresh in the water.",1,null,!1,!1,!1,B.k,B.T)
B.a9U=A.a(s(["4\u20136 person tent","4 sleeping bags","4 sleeping pads","Cooler","4 camp chairs"]),t.s)
B.OY=new A.bq("Family Camp Package","Camping","\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f","Enough gear to get the whole family out there without renting piece by piece.\n\nWhat's included:\n\u2022 4-6 person tent\n\u2022 4 sleeping bags\n\u2022 4 sleeping pads\n\u2022 Cooler\n\u2022 4 camp chairs\n\nIdeal for families visiting Alaska in summer who want a real outdoor experience without the baggage fees.",125,null,!0,!1,!1,B.a9U,B.T)
B.a45=A.a(s(["Tent","2 sleeping bags","2 sleeping pads","2 camp chairs","Cooler","Tarp"]),t.s)
B.Pi=new A.bq("Weekend Warrior Bundle","Camping","\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f","Everything for a 2-night trip, priced as a flat weekend rate. Grab it Friday, return it Sunday.\n\nWhat's included:\n\u2022 Tent\n\u2022 2 sleeping bags\n\u2022 2 sleeping pads\n\u2022 2 camp chairs\n\u2022 Cooler\n\u2022 Tarp\n\nFlat rate for the whole weekend. No daily math, no nickel-and-diming.",75,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/ecfb97050_A4C24A01-57E0-43CF-AFC5-489A0FCDA1A3.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.a45,B.T)
B.a_6=A.a(s(["2-person tent","2 sleeping bags","2 sleeping pads","2 camp chairs","2-burner stove","Cookware set","Lantern","Tarp"]),t.s)
B.OW=new A.bq("Dual Basecamp Kit","Camping","\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f","Our most popular camping package. Everything two people need to set up a solid basecamp in Alaska.\n\nWhat's included:\n\u2022 2-person tent\n\u2022 2 sleeping bags\n\u2022 2 sleeping pads\n\u2022 2 camp chairs\n\u2022 2-burner stove\n\u2022 Cookware set\n\u2022 Lantern\n\u2022 Tarp\n\nGreat for couples, friends, or anyone who wants a comfortable setup without the hassle of hauling gear.",40,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/fb5d9a1b6_IMG_8969.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.a_6,B.T)
B.a3h=A.a(s(["Lightweight 1-person tent","Sleeping bag","Sleeping pad","Backpack","Compact stove + fuel","Mess kit"]),t.s)
B.Pc=new A.bq("Solo Adventurer Pack","Camping","\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f","Everything you need for a solo backcountry trip along Turnagain Arm. Packed light and ready to go.\n\nWhat's included:\n\u2022 Lightweight 1-person tent\n\u2022 Sleeping bag\n\u2022 Sleeping pad\n\u2022 Backpack\n\u2022 Compact stove + fuel\n\u2022 Mess kit\n\nPerfect for hikers passing through or spending a few nights out on the trail.",30,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/c9425b2e7_IMG_9013.jpg",!0,!1,!1,B.a3h,B.T)
