B.Po=new A.bq("Winter Day Pack","Winter","\u2744\ufe0f","Insulated 30L daypack built for cold-weather use. Hydration-compatible with an insulated sleeve to prevent hose freeze-up.",15,null,!1,!1,!1,B.k,B.a4X)
