B.Pr=new A.bq("The Connectivity Kit (Starlink)","Add-Ons","\ud83c\udf92","Cell service in Alaska gets thin fast once you leave the highway. This package gives you reliable internet just about anywhere you can see the sky.\n\nThe Starlink Mini is a real, working internet connection. Not a satellite messenger, not an SOS device. You can check weather, video call home, handle work, or stream a movie at camp. It packs up small and it's tougher than it looks.\n\nComes with the cables and a protective case, so you can throw it in your gear and go. Great for remote hunts, fishing trips, off-grid camping, or anyone who needs to stay reachable from the field.\n\nNote: Speeds vary depending on location, network traffic, and weather. Starlink manages the network, so we can't guarantee specific speeds.\n\nWhat's Included:\n\u2022 Starlink Mini\n\u2022 Protective case\n\u2022 Charging cables",25,"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cc33ead8900ab3dab19df0/f996486f9_IMG_1713.jpg",!0,!0,!1,B.abl,B.T)
B.ZV=A.a(s(["Minelab Equinox 800 Metal Detector","Pinpointer","Trowel"]),t.s)
B.OX=new A.bq("Metal Detecting Package","Add-Ons","\ud83c\udf92","Alaska has more buried history than people realize. Old mining sites, ghost towns, beaches that have seen a hundred years of foot traffic. This package gives you a real tool for digging into it.\n\nThe Minelab Equinox 800 is one of the best detectors on the market. It's not a toy, and it'll find things you'd never spot otherwise. The pinpointer and trowel get you the rest of the way to whatever you've found.\n\nAlways check land status and local rules before detecting. State parks, federal land, and historic sites have different policies.\n\nWhat's Included:\n\u2022 Minelab Equinox 800 metal detector\n\u2022 Pinpointer\n\u2022 Trowel",20,null,!0,!1,!1,B.ZV,B.T)
B.a2i=A.a(s(["Action camera","Several mounting attachments","Extra battery","Charger","*Memory card not included \u2014 purchase one or bring your own*"]),t.s)
B.OZ=new A.bq("Action Camera Package","Add-Ons","\ud83c\udf92","If you want to capture your trip without risking your phone, this is an easy way to do it.\n\nThis package gives you a solid action camera setup that's ready for whatever you get into, whether that's fishing, riding, hiking, or just exploring. It's simple to use and comes with the mounts you need to get good footage from different angles.\n\nThrow it on your gear, hit record, and you're good to go.\n\nIncludes:\n\n\u2022 Action camera\n\u2022 Multiple mounting attachments\n\u2022 Extra battery\n\u2022 Charger\n\nGood for:\n\n\u2022 Fishing trips\n\u2022 Off-road and outdoor adventures\n\u2022 Hiking and camping\n\u2022 Anyone wanting to capture their trip hands-free\n\nNote: Memory card is not included. You'll need to bring your own or purchase one before use.",15,null,!0,!1,!1,B.a2i,B.T)
B.a52=A.a(s(["Berry Picking Basket","Bucket","Ziplock Bags"]),t.s)
B.Pu=new A.bq("Berry Picking Package","Add-Ons","\ud83c\udf92","Alaska is one of the best places in the world for wild berry picking. Blueberries, raspberries, salmonberries, low-bush cranberries. The bushes are out there, and they're free.\n\nThis is a small, simple package that just makes the job easier. The basket clips on so you have both hands free, the bucket holds a real day's haul, and the bags are for getting them home in one piece.\n\nBest in late summer through early fall. Talk to locals about where to go, and always be bear-aware in good berry country.\n\nWhat's Included:\n\u2022 Berry picking basket\n\u2022 Bucket\n\u2022 Ziplock bags",15,null,!0,!1,!1,B.a52,B.T)
B.a2B=A.a(s(["Gold Pan","Classifier","Bucket","Shovel"]),t.s)
B.PF=new A.bq("Gold Panning Package","Add-Ons","\ud83c\udf92","Everything you need for a day of gold panning in Alaska. This package includes all the tools to find your fortune in local creeks and streams.",15,null,!0,!1,!1,B.a2B,B.T)
